  "_id": "XHBedKgZUYK6K1MJ",
  "name": "诸空牌组 Deck of Dimensions (BMT)",
  "type": "equipment",
  "system": {
    "source": {
      "custom": "",
      "book": "BMT",
      "page": "40",
      "license": "",
      "rules": "2014",
      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>奇物，极珍稀（需同调）</em> <br>这副牌的卡背有着交错复杂的装饰，代表着不同的存在位面。此牌组具有6发充能。持握该牌组期间，你可以花费1发或多发充能来使用以下能力：<br><strong>记号牌Marked Card。</strong>以一个附赠动作，你可以花费1发充能用从牌组中抽取一张牌，将它扔到在你周围5尺范围内的未被占据空间内。这张牌上会被标上一个隐形的印记。在接下来的24小时内，你可以用一个动作说出作记号卡片的名字，你（以及你佩戴或携带的任何装备）将传送回这张卡的位置，并出现在离标记卡最近的空间。通过这种方式传送后、或者8小时内未使用该牌之后，牌就会回到牌组里，印记也会消失。 （注：前文又说24小时，后文又说8小时......）</p><p><strong>对切之门Riffling Portal。</strong>以一个动作，你可以花费3发充能来用牌组施展法术 <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.GoHxmQDNg9i6lWU3]{秘法门 Arcane Gate}</em> 。卡组会飞出并组合成一个卡牌圆环，以充当那个法术的传送门。当法术效果结束时，这套牌组会重新重组回到你的手中。 <br><strong>洗切之行Shuffling Stride。</strong>以一个附赠动作，你可以花费1发充能，将卡组的一张卡投掷到你周围60尺范围内的一处未被占据的空间内，然后你（以及你佩戴或携带的任何装备）将传送到这里。那之后掷出的卡牌将消失并回到卡组中。<br>每日黎明时分，此牌组将恢复[[/r 1d6]]发已被消耗的充能数。</p><p>The backs of the cards in this deck are decorated with intricate designs representing different planes of existence. The deck has 6 charges. While holding it, you can expend 1 or more of its charges to use the following properties:</p><ul class=\"rd__list rd__list-hang-notitle\"><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Marked Card\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Marked Card.</span> As a bonus action, you can expend 1 charge to draw a card from the deck and place it in an unoccupied space within 5 feet of you. The card then becomes marked with an invisible sigil. Once within the next 24 hours, as an action, you can speak the marked card's name and teleport to the card's location, along with any equipment you are wearing or carrying, appearing in the closest unoccupied space to the card. After you teleport in this way, or after 8 hours, the card returns to the deck, and the mark on it fades.</p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Riffling Portal\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Riffling Portal.</span> As an action, you can expend 3 charges to cast the @spell[Arcane Gate] spell from the deck. The deck vanishes, and fluttering cards create the spell's portal rings. When the spell ends, the deck reappears in your possession.</p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Shuffling Stride\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Shuffling Stride.</span> As a bonus action, you can expend 1 charge to throw a card from the deck to an unoccupied space within 60 feet of yourself and teleport, along with any equipment you're wearing or carrying, to that space. The card then vanishes and returns to the deck.</p></li></ul><p>The deck regains [[/r 1d6]] expended charges daily at dawn.</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
